#!/bin/bash
# Rebuild idunn and reset the linux-builder VM so it uses
# nix-cache.martinache.net as a substituter again. Counterpart to
# bin/builder-no-cache - see that script for why this needs a VM reset
# rather than a flag.

set -euo pipefail

SCRIPT_DIR="$(cd "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")" &>/dev/null && pwd)"
MARKER="/tmp/builder-no-cache-marker"

rm -f "$MARKER"

echo "==> Rebuilding idunn (linux-builder cache substituter enabled)..."
"$SCRIPT_DIR/nix-deploy" local switch

echo "==> Resetting linux-builder VM to pick up the new config..."
echo "y" | "$SCRIPT_DIR/nix-deploy" runner-reset
